<title>UK: Goldman sets warrants on Brent Crude oil.</title>
<headline>Goldman sets warrants on Brent Crude oil.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued a total of three million American-style call and put warrants in three equal tranches on Brent Crude oil, lead manager Goldnan Sachs &amp; Co HG said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   24.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $17.35</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE    ISSUE    PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	$19.0     $2.0     21.04 PCT  8.68 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	$22.0     $1.0     32.56 PCT 17.35 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT C	$19.0     $2.77     6.46 PCT  6.26 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
